{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29761","headline":"宫中曲 · 李商隐","name":"宫中曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云母滤宫月，夜夜白於水。\n赚得羊车来，低扇遮黄子。\n水精不觉冷，自刻鸳鸯翅。\n蚕缕茜香浓，正朝缠左臂。\n巴牋两三幅，满写承恩字。\n欲得识青天，昨夜苍龙是。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29761.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29761","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}